{"id":1276,"level":75,"name":"Захист від подвійного нападу","group":"Захист","format":27,"description":"<p>In several lessons we learned about the double attack. A double attack occurs when&nbsp;two pieces are attacked at the same time!</p>  <p>There are several ways to defend against a double attack. The following methods can be effective against a double attack:</p>  <ul>  <li>interposing</li>  <li>capturing the attacker</li>  <li>counter attacking&nbsp;</li>  <li>Protecting your pieces</li>  </ul>  <h3>What do you have to do?</h3>  <p>Try to defend against the double attack.</p>  <p></p>","assignment":"","stickerID":83,"examples":[{"fen":"8/5k2/8/q5B1/8/2R2K2/8/8 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%cal Ra5c3,Ra5g5]} 1. Bd2 1-0","text":"<p>Чорні мають жорстоку подвійний напад, але за допомогою розумного захисту білі можуть врятувати обидві фігури.</p>","format":27},{"fen":"6k1/2R5/8/q7/8/8/3KR3/8 w - - 0 0","pgn":"{[%cal Ra5c7,Ra5d2,Gc7c3]} 1. Rc3 1/2-1/2","text":"<p>тура і король атакуються. Проте це не проблема, тому що білі можуть врятувати туру, поставивши туру між королем і ворожою ферзем.</p>","format":27}],"puzzles":[{"id":45171,"fen":"r3k2r/pp3ppp/1b2q1n1/7Q/4P1b1/1NP3B1/PP3PPP/2KR2NR w kq - 0 1","pgn":"{[%cal Rg4h5,Rg4d1]} 1. Qb5+ 1-0","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":45148,"fen":"2kr3r/pbp2Np1/1p2pn1p/2q5/8/5P2/PPP1Q1PP/2KRR3 b - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%cal Rf7h8,Rf7d8]} 1... Rxd1+ 2. Rxd1 {[%cal Gh8e8]} 0-1","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":45136,"fen":"2k2r2/pp4p1/2n1p2p/3n1q2/4N1rQ/P7/1PPB1PPP/R4RK1 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%cal Yg4h4,Yg4e4]} 1. Nd6+ {[%cal Yd6c8,Yd6f5]} Kd7 2. Nxf5 Rxh4 3. Nxh4 1-0","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":45153,"fen":"5rk1/pp2b1pp/8/2q2p2/Q1r1p3/6P1/P1N2PB1/R4RK1 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Yg8][%cal Rc4a4,Rc4c2]} 1. Qb3 {[%csl Gc2,Rc4][%cal Yb3g8]} 1/2-1/2","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":45170,"fen":"5bk1/2n2